counted — prefix tokens\n    were included in the entropy/bits-per-tok calculation. Now skips\n    prefix_len + prompt_token_len.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n generate.py | 19 +++++++++++++++++--\n 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n\ncommit 048377fa898cd5d5f338b54cbe69bffa76d8731e\nAuthor: evintunador <evintunador@gmail.com>\nDate:   Mon Mar 23 20:57:33 2026 +0000\n\n    feat(gen): Stage 3.3 trace, Stage 3.4 hardening, Stage 4.1 end-of-training demo\n    \n    Stage 3.3 — GenerationTrace + logging:\n    - Add GenerationTrace dataclass (8 counters: fwd passes, tokens generated,\n      links_detected, links_resolved, corpus_fetches, docs_generated, docs_evicted,\n      max_depth_reached) to generation_result.py; add trace field to GenerationResult\n    - Thread GenerationTrace through all generation_loop private functions; populate\n      counters at each event; emit logging.DEBUG per event, logging.INFO run summary\n    - DocumentContext gains _eviction_count / eviction_count for docs_evicted counter\n    - generate.py summary section now renders trace fields\n    \n    Stage 3.4 — Edge case hardening:\n    - Move depth >= max_link_depth guard to top of _handle_link (before corpus and\n      re-eviction branches); max_link_depth=0 now disables ALL aux doc insertion\n    - GenerationConfig.__post_init__ validates max_tokens_per_document <= max_context_length\n      and max_new_tokens <= max_tokens_per_document\n    - generate.py: clamp max_tokens_per_document >= max_new_tokens to avoid validation error\n    - Fix max_tokens_per_document check in _generate_doc to include prefix_tokens length\n    - Update 5 tests whose configs violated the new cross-field invariants\n    \n    Stage 4.1 — End-of-training generation demo:\n    - Add _run_generation_demo() to main.py; called after smart_train under is_main_process\n    - Auto-selects prompts by detector type (MarkdownLinkDetector vs PythonImportDetector)\n    - Lo